Subject: [PATCH 15/20] Android: pinch to zoom and two-finger pan, and flash
 diagnostics

CanvasGestures (Java) turns trackpad pinches (CLASSIFICATION_PINCH) and
two-finger touchscreen gestures into Patchy's native zoom gesture and
pixel-delta wheel events on the widget under the fingers; a single finger
still draws (it is held back ~90 ms in case a second one lands). Temporary
CanvasDiag log lines trace window corrections, caption changes and
application states while a reported flash is tracked down.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
